{
  "rationale": "Use a small plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in specifications. The policy gives priority to forward progress in clear conditions, uses one-shot obstacle recovery states, keeps uncontrollable sensing total in every specification state, self-loops non-critical path_clear in commit/recovery states, and returns quickly to forward exploration after recovery.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate environment sensing from motion capability in plant automata",
    "Use one policy specification with perception and one-shot action states to enforce safe forward-biased exploration",
    "Use directed turning away from side obstacles and reserve backward motion for front-obstacle escape only",
    "Use full_rotate only in a dedicated last-resort blocked state after repeated front blockage"
